Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,WARNING: IMAGES OF SUICIDE AND SELF-HARM.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.29,0:00:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,NAPOLEON BONAPARTE\NTHE MASTER STRATEGIST OF THE 19TH CENTURY
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.79,0:01:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,ONE HUNDRED YEARS OF SOLITUDE
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.08,0:01:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Aureliano asked Arcadio\Nto get Macondo in better shape
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.29,0:01:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,than how he'd left it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.21,0:01:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Arcadio had a very unique interpretation\Nof this request.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.67,0:01:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He's dressed like a general.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.92,0:01:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,People of Macondo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.33,0:01:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The true essence of Macondo\Nmust be restored by all of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.42,0:02:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! We must do it together!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.29,0:02:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I have decided…\Nthat as of right this second,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.96,0:02:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,all men are required by law to report\Nfor military service at the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.00,0:02:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone will have to wear the bandana\Nthat my soldiers will hand out right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.83,0:02:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Every house,\Nevery establishment, every wall
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.96,0:02:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,will bear the same red color of our party!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.92,0:02:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Our party, huh? Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.42,0:02:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen. It's one thing for us to stand up\Nagainst the Conservative violence,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.42,0:02:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,but our people have been free\Nsince before you were even born!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.33,0:02:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true. That's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.00,0:02:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What would your son say then, Matilde?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.33,0:02:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he not risking his life out there,\Nwith the colonel?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.25,0:02:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,With this bandana around his arm too, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.54,0:02:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone standing here has seen\Nwhat these bastards are willing to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.67,0:03:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So ask yourself,\Nwhat are we willing to do for ourselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.79,0:03:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever is necessary, Catarino!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.54,0:03:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Because this is our town!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.08,0:03:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-This is our territory!\N-Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.08,0:03:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,To the Liberals! Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.79,0:03:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.50,0:03:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-Long live the Liberal Party!\N-To the Liberals!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.29,0:03:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-I wonder what Úrsula thinks, Father.\N-She won't think anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.83,0:03:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Arcadio is still a child,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.25,0:03:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,and what he's doing\Nis simply a show, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.75,0:03:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, Father.\NI don't think he's a child anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.54,0:03:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't listen to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.58,0:03:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,His bark is worse than his bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.46,0:03:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,One side each.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.79,0:03:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.83,0:03:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-Come on, Father.\N-What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.13,0:03:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hey!\N-Amen!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.42,0:03:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him! stop it! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.33,0:03:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-Lock it. Let's go!\N-No, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.25,0:03:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-Stay still, Father!\N-Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.75,0:03:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stay in there! Go, go, go!\NCareful, man. Watch your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.88,0:03:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-Open the door! Hey!\N-Hey! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.33,0:04:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.63,0:04:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.96,0:04:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.21,0:04:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebeca's firm character\Nand the voracity of her stomach,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.92,0:04:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,absorbed José Arcadio's boundless energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.38,0:04:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He went from being a lazy womanizer\Nto a massive work animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.17,0:04:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It was said that he had begun\Nby plowing his own yard
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.13,0:04:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,and that he continued\Nstraight ahead into neighboring lands,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.21,0:04:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,knocking down fences and ranches
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.25,0:04:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,until he seized\Nthe best plots of land around.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.08,0:05:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.04,0:05:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That your house over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.29,0:05:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.29,0:05:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,How may I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.25,0:05:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,How, uh… how much do you pay for all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.83,0:05:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-Pay?\N-To who exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.21,0:05:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This land belongs to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.92,0:05:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,According to who?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.63,0:05:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And who are you to come here\Nand ask me about all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.08,0:05:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,José Arcadio Buendía.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.63,0:05:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The eldest son of the founder of Macondo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.75,0:05:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.79,0:05:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,your old man knows\Nthat we have lived in this home
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.83,0:06:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,since long before the awful insomnia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.17,0:06:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks to me like you appropriated land\Nthat belongs to my family,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.63,0:06:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,after my father went insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.50,0:06:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And you never paid him anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.38,0:06:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Or am I wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.71,0:06:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Those bastards aren't just murdering us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.83,0:07:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They're humiliating us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.96,0:07:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how many weapons they have.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.38,0:07:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do as you say, Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.63,0:07:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.21,0:08:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Colonel Carmona,\NI'm Colonel Aureliano Buendía.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.04,0:08:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna get you outta here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.58,0:08:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.96,0:08:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Liberals!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.42,0:08:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.79,0:08:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to get Carmona! Go get Carmona!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.54,0:08:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They need me as a hostage, Colonel!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.63,0:08:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Save your people!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.00,0:08:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Colonel! Today's not the day, Colonel!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.29,0:08:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Soldier! Today's not the day!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.75,0:08:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll come back for you\Nas soon as I have more men.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.33,0:08:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You have my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.79,0:09:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-Aureliano!\N-So stay strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.33,0:09:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat, soldiers!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.79,0:09:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-Let's go!\N-Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.21,0:09:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.13,0:09:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Visbal! Visbal!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.33,0:09:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We had them, my friend.\NWe have to keep fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.13,0:09:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it easy, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.38,0:09:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Throwing blows\Nisn't gonna help you recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.29,0:09:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.96,0:09:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Aureliano, what are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.21,0:09:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Trying to leave camp like this\Nis pointless. It's going to be impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.71,0:10:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to go and find help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.25,0:10:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.29,0:10:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be a camp of Conservatives\Nin every town from here to San Juan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.17,0:10:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but my odds are better if I go alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.67,0:10:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.38,0:11:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Evening. I need your help, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.33,0:11:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to do this, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.13,0:11:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.67,0:11:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-No!\N-Get back inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.21,0:11:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.29,0:11:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Catarino, give me that bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.88,0:11:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What did he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.17,0:11:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He says that I have to pay him\Nfor the ten years
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.29,0:11:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,that I have been working the land\Nwe live on… or he'll shoot me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.63,0:11:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.08,0:11:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The same boy, the same José Arcadio\Nthat took his clothes off
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.54,0:11:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,right there at that table\Nand raffled himself off to women?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.38,0:11:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The same exact one. That's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.25,0:11:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to talk to Arcadio,\Nsee if he knows that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.21,0:11:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm. That's the right thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.00,0:12:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he gonna do about it?\NChase him around with his imaginary spear?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.21,0:12:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Anibal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.58,0:12:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember this is\NMacondo's civil and military chief
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.67,0:12:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,we're referring to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.63,0:12:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm talking about\Na young boy who's gone mad
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.63,0:12:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,and walks around in a costume\Nsaying all sorts of nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.50,0:12:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you pay so much attention\Nto that boy, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.58,0:12:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The reason I pay attention\Nis because he is the one
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.08,0:12:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,that Colonel Aureliano Buendía\Nput in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.33,0:12:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, if you don't respect\Nwhat Arcadio says,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.29,0:12:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,does that mean\Nyou don't respect Aureliano either?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.54,0:12:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, my friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.50,0:12:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We gonna fight over this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.63,0:12:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me which side you're on,\Nand I'll tell you if we're fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.33,0:12:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we're on the same side.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.96,0:12:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh. All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.38,0:12:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a drink, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.33,0:12:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.08,0:12:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Aim your guns!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.50,0:13:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.25,0:13:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, boys. Let's go! Again!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.88,0:13:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.38,0:13:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Aim!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.33,0:13:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Arcadio! Catarino!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.63,0:13:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-Goddamn it!\N-Son of a…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.58,0:13:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't just shoot!\NYou have to listen to orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.50,0:13:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-What's going on?\N-I need to speak to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.17,0:13:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to train those dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.50,0:13:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-I'm joking.\N-Don't you dare touch my dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.21,0:13:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,They won't calm down.\NTo what do we owe this pleasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.71,0:13:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you, sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.79,0:13:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You're our very first visitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.92,0:13:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hot. Can I have something to drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.63,0:13:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I was hoping we could talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.33,0:13:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.25,0:13:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I was on my way out. What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.00,0:14:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been told about what you're doing\Nin the fields, and we need to discuss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.50,0:14:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't meddle in your affairs,\Nso why are you meddling in mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.42,0:14:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.17,0:14:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,my position forces me\Nto meddle in everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.13,0:14:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it. You can relax.\NI didn't come here for an explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.96,0:14:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I came to legalize it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.21,0:14:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No property has ever been\Nregistered in this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.96,0:14:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.79,0:14:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,All you have to do\Nto become the owner of the land
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.13,0:14:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,is to sign this form right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.79,0:14:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, we expect you to make\Na small contribution to our office.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.88,0:14:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. You could pay us\Nwith what you earn from your plots.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.13,0:14:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.67,0:14:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That's certainly something\NI won't meddle in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.92,0:14:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.50,0:15:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,"According to official sources,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.42,0:15:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,the rebels have devastated\Nentire populations,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.00,0:15:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,and all in the name of the Liberal Party."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.13,0:15:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.21,0:15:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And where's the part that says\Nhow the Conservatives got here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.08,0:15:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,They just forget to include that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.54,0:15:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.92,0:15:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Tied up, like a madman.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.42,0:15:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm glad your here, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.29,0:15:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.04,0:15:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows what you'd do\Nif you had any idea
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.17,0:15:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,of what's been going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.04,0:15:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.54,0:15:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.46,0:15:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? What is it? Visitación!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.00,0:15:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at me. Pietro! Pietro! Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.92,0:15:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-I'm coming, what's going on?\N-Look at me, Visitación!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.75,0:15:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-Visitación!\N-Help me, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.88,0:17:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here, son?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.21,0:17:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I think this is the place\Nwhere your mother realized
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.54,0:17:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,we had been moving around in circles.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.46,0:17:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I have this peculiar feeling\NI've already been through all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.13,0:17:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You know,\NI never actually told your mother
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.29,0:17:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,that I never stopped being lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.38,0:18:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,As if I haven't been over\Nat his house since he was a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.75,0:18:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,As if I wasn't,\Nfor all intents and purposes,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.75,0:18:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,part of his family.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.42,0:18:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And now he's building\Nthat colossal house all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.50,0:18:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,With whose money?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.13,0:18:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,With ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.29,0:18:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see. What does it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.50,0:18:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It says that his office\Nactually has the right
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.46,0:18:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,to 15% of every drink I sell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.83,0:18:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Women must pay 20%\Nfor every customer they fuck,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.17,0:18:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,and that you must pay 8%\Nof your total earnings.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.58,0:18:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But why is our percentage higher?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.33,0:18:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.71,0:18:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the things my dear friend José Arcadio\Nwould do
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.29,0:18:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,if he wasn't tied up\Nto that old chestnut tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.79,0:18:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-Just what we needed.\N-No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.63,0:18:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.96,0:18:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.96,0:18:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Catarino.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.88,0:19:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you bring over some rum\Nfor, uh… for us and, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.79,0:19:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,some water for Franco, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.71,0:19:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.54,0:19:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna pay the full amount,\Nor should I deduct what I have to pay you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.63,0:19:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to\Npay me anything, Catarino.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.75,0:19:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What you're paying for is the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.71,0:19:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Or how do you think\Nit'll be financed? With will?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.58,0:19:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And here I was thinking\Nyou were on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.75,0:19:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where's the music?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.92,0:19:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Or can't you afford that anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.83,0:19:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. Of course he can.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.29,0:19:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There will always be music in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.75,0:19:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ One of my dear old friends ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.75,0:20:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Begs for rum at this cantina ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.08,0:20:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Stealing money from the women ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.00,0:20:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-♪ Sending all our men to war-- ♪\N-Sing something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.17,0:20:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.\NSomething happier, something nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.08,0:20:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, give me a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.79,0:20:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.83,0:20:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.29,0:21:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So there won't always be music after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.71,0:21:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother! Aníbal!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.92,0:21:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Anibal!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.58,0:21:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.88,0:21:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Arcadio!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.42,0:21:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Arcadio!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.46,0:22:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanna talk to him. Arcadio!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.83,0:22:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-Pilar, what's the matter?\N-Santa Sofía, I need to talk to Arcadio.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.50,0:22:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.92,0:22:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked the cards about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.00,0:22:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.54,0:22:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.42,0:22:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No one cares about you\Nmore than I do. Believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.75,0:22:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,In the future,\Na woman will try to give you advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.25,0:22:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to listen to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.54,0:22:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.17,0:22:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He needs to stay alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.67,0:22:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Please tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.42,0:23:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.17,0:23:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise you're not the first\NLiberal soldier to find refuge here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.04,0:24:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for everything,\Nbut my men are waiting for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.67,0:24:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.83,0:24:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,There are men everywhere\Ntrying to find Liberals like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.38,0:24:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, ma'am,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.88,0:24:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.17,0:24:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to find reinforcements.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.71,0:24:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take you to someone who can help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.96,0:24:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But not before sunset.\NWe stay inside until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.33,0:24:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because of them that we do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.33,0:24:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,There are hawks outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.67,0:24:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Wait! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.29,0:25:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He's one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.33,0:25:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-I'm Colonel Aureliano Buendía!\N-Let him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.00,0:25:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost several of my men\Nwhen trying to rescue Colonel Carmona.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.83,0:25:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And those of us who survived
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.00,0:25:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,are mostly severely wounded now
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.75,0:25:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,and in need of something to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.29,0:25:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I have heard rumors about you,\NColonel Buendía.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.46,0:25:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Colonel Gregorio Stevenson.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.42,0:25:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Pleasure to meet you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.83,0:25:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Pleasure, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.54,0:25:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,When are we leaving then?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.67,0:25:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We leave when you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.29,0:26:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,My friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.17,0:26:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Visbal?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.00,0:26:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't just our men\Nthat the Conservatives killed, Gerineldo.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.83,0:26:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,They're doing the same thing all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.63,0:26:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to put a stop to this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.08,0:27:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This sorry excuse\Nof a government must fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.79,0:27:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I know that the army\Nhas more resources than we do…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.13,0:27:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,but we have something\Nthose other men don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.88,0:27:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a fighting spirit
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.33,0:27:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,and the greatest debt of honor\Nto our fallen other soldiers!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.42,0:27:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But our priority is to save our people.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.46,0:27:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, what are\Nany of us fighting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.33,0:27:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And I don't know\Nif you feel the same way I do…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.96,0:27:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,but we musn't stop fighting,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.88,0:27:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,not until we make\Nthose sons of bitches pay us all back
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.67,0:27:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,every last single drop of blood\Nthat our men have shed for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.21,0:27:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-Long live Colonel Buendía!\N-To Buendía!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.25,0:27:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And long live the Liberal Party!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.96,0:28:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Long live the Liberals!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.71,0:28:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-The Liberals are coming!\N-Liberals approaching!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.08,0:28:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,For the Liberal Party!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.83,0:28:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,"Úrsula. Mother."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.96,0:28:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,"I won't deny that sometimes,\Nwe suffer from hunger."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.17,0:28:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,"I have not stopped being afraid,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.29,0:28:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,and I am getting used to\Nburying my friends…"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.63,0:28:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,"…but there is a profound feeling\Nthat keeps us going."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.17,0:28:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,"Maybe it's because we're\Nbrushing against death
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.67,0:28:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,or because we are\Nfighting for what is just."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.00,0:28:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,"I don't know."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.92,0:28:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,"But the truth is\Nthat nothing has ever felt more right
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.63,0:28:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,than being with those who are unwilling\Nto bend a knee to anyone."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.96,0:28:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,"I am sorry I cannot tell you\Nwhere I'm headed
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.75,0:29:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,or how long it'll be\Nbefore we meet again."
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.50,0:29:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,"But I can assure you that now,\Nmore than ever,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.04,0:29:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I am awake."
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.71,0:29:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.08,0:29:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't ever see my boy again, Visitación.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.29,0:29:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Either a bullet or starvation\Nwill get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.21,0:29:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, child?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.50,0:29:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.83,0:29:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be starvation.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.42,0:30:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.83,0:30:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,please do me this favor,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.67,0:30:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,and bring Father Nicanor.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.75,0:30:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.42,0:30:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Father Nicanor!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.79,0:30:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Father Nicanor!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.75,0:30:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! God bless you, Úrsula.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.88,0:31:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear God, Father. Who did this to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.83,0:31:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Arcadio.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.71,0:31:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Arcadio!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.33,0:31:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare put your hands on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.96,0:31:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Arcadio!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.29,0:31:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't even think of touching me!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.25,0:31:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you? Where is he?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.79,0:31:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Good afternoon to you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.79,0:31:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready to pay your taxes?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.79,0:31:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.67,0:31:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The civil and military authority\Nof our people.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.29,0:31:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,When Aureliano finds out\Nthat you murdered Aníbal
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.63,0:31:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,and that you've\Nbeen taking advantage of this town,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.33,0:31:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,he'll have you shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.04,0:31:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll be first to celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.58,0:31:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a disgrace to the Buendía name.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.75,0:32:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Make no mistake, Arcadio.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.38,0:32:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's one thing to fear
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.29,0:32:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,and another to respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.08,0:32:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Úrsula.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.21,0:32:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm honored that I'm not a Buendía.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.08,0:32:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You made that quite clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.92,0:32:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let her go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.67,0:32:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,After the confusion\Nof Rebeca's vehement fondling,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.42,0:32:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Pietro Crespi found love in Amaranta.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.46,0:32:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that park in Firenze very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.54,0:33:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's full of beautiful flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.96,0:33:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Amaranta,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.58,0:33:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it hasn't been that long…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.21,0:33:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,but Úrsula has already\Ngiven us her blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.21,0:33:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And besides,\NI think Aureliano José deserves a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.63,0:33:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.96,0:33:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And I would love nothing more in the world
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.33,0:33:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,than to take you to see Italy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.83,0:33:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Amaranta Buendía…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.33,0:33:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,will you marry me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.54,0:34:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't have to be right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.13,0:34:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Not this coming month or year or ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.46,0:34:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If you really love me, Pietro,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.25,0:34:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,don't come back to this house again.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.63,0:35:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Where are you? ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.92,0:35:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Where are you ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.00,0:35:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ My beloved? ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.17,0:35:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Come console ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.33,0:35:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ The soul ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.67,0:35:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ The soul ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.42,0:35:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Come ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.92,0:35:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Come ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.67,0:35:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ My beloved ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.75,0:35:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Where… ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.46,0:35:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Macondo woke up\Nin a sort of angelic stupor…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.04,0:35:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,caused by the sounds\Nof a string instrument…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.00,0:35:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,…the world was not worthy of.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.83,0:36:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And the most adoring voice\Nthe Earth could ever conceive.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.29,0:36:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Come ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.46,0:36:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Come console ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.00,0:36:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ The soul ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.42,0:37:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Perpetual light\Nshine upon him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.96,0:37:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Eternal rest,\Ngrant unto him, O Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.17,0:37:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Let perpetual light\Nshine upon him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.17,0:37:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Eternal rest,\Ngrant unto him, O Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.29,0:37:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And let\Nperpetual light shine upon him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.21,0:37:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Eternal rest,\Ngrant unto him, O Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.67,0:37:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And let\Nperpetual light shine upon him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.88,0:37:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Eternal rest,\Ngrant unto him, O Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.58,0:37:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And let\Nperpetual light shine upon him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.63,0:37:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Eternal rest,\Ngrant unto him, O Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.08,0:38:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And let\Nperpetual light shine upon him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.25,0:38:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Eternal rest,\Ngrant unto him, O Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.54,0:38:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And let\Nperpetual light shine upon him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.83,0:38:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Eternal rest,\Ngrant unto him, O Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.67,0:38:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And let\Nperpetual light shine upon him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.17,0:38:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Eternal rest,\Ngrant unto him, O Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.21,0:38:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And let\Nperpetual light shine upon him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.92,0:38:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Eternal rest,\Ngrant unto him, O Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.21,0:38:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And let\Nperpetual light shine upon him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.92,0:38:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Úrsula abandoned her forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.92,0:39:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready! Aim guide!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.63,0:39:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.29,0:39:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.58,0:39:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Aim! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.13,0:39:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.54,0:39:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Aim!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.96,0:39:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.50,0:39:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.38,0:39:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Aim! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.83,0:39:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.38,0:39:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Aim! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.00,0:39:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mr. Moscote.\N-Catarino.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.63,0:39:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, since the incident with Aníbal,\Nno one wants to go out.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.38,0:40:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Musicians fled to neighboring towns,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.00,0:40:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,and the women in my establishment\Nare starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.46,0:40:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, how is that my concern?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.21,0:40:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, you're the mayor, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.96,0:40:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't put an end\Nto Arcadio's nonsense, then who will?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.50,0:40:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Catarino.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.92,0:40:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.79,0:40:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But now you all have what you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.21,0:40:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A Liberal paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.96,0:40:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, go enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.29,0:40:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at what we have come to,\NJosé Arcadio Buendía.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.79,0:40:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at our empty house.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.92,0:40:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Just the two of us,\Nas it was when it all began.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.92,0:40:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Our children,\Na true disgrace to the family name.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.58,0:41:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't listen to what I tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.63,0:41:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,God wanted\NRebeca and José Arcadio to get married,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.42,0:41:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,and they're both very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.33,0:41:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And Aureliano… seems like our son\Nhas become a real hero out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.46,0:41:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.79,0:41:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He sent us a letter not long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.83,0:41:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to read it?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.17,0:41:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He hasn't written to us in months.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.50,0:41:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Úrsula!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.75,0:42:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Úrsula!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.79,0:42:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Úrsula!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.25,0:42:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Do something, please! Do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.38,0:42:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You continue to defy the law!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.88,0:42:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Say what you will about me!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.88,0:42:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But we will always be listening to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.42,0:42:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.29,0:42:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Aim!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.71,0:42:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I dare you, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.54,0:42:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-Don't push it, Úrsula.\N-Or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.42,0:42:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll kill me as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.25,0:42:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it. Just do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.38,0:43:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather die than cry the shame\Nof having raised a fucking monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.13,0:43:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I said get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.46,0:43:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Murderer! Murderer!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.58,0:43:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you see\Nthat you're terrorizing your own people?!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.63,0:43:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.54,0:43:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The Colonel entrusted me
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.79,0:43:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,as the civil and military chief\Nof Macondo!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.08,0:43:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Aureliano is dead now!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.17,0:43:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you gonna do, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.29,0:43:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're worthless, Arcadio.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.96,0:43:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.75,0:43:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody will paint their house\Nthe way they see fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.50,0:43:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time you try to extort\Nor kill someone else in this town…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.42,0:43:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I will find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.88,0:44:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.04,0:44:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Úrsula. Úrsula. Úrsula.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.96,0:44:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,There, there. It's going to be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.04,0:45:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,From that day on,\Nshe was the one who ruled the town.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.50,0:45:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But in spite of her fortitude,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.92,0:45:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,she still wept over her unfortunate fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.75,0:46:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Has no one paid?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.21,0:46:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No one, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.00,0:46:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.63,0:46:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-A woman's here to see you.\N-Franco, I don't want visitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.71,0:46:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.79,0:46:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Move back!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.75,0:46:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.71,0:46:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, I'm Colonel Gregorio Stevenson.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.96,0:46:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Colonel Buendía sent me here\Nin order to deliver a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.83,0:46:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The Conservative army is on its way.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.46,0:47:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,They're near.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.79,0:47:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The colonel orders you\Nto surrender when they arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.08,0:47:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-Take him away.\N-Come here, you liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.00,0:47:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me! Please don't!\NThere are over 500--
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.25,0:47:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's enough!\N-They carry heavy artillery!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.42,0:47:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-Resisting will lead to a massacre!\N-Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.54,0:47:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Do as the colonel says!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.92,0:47:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Do as a dead man says?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.33,0:47:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The Colonel isn't dead, Arcadio!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.46,0:47:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been fighting\Nalongside General Medina for months.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.13,0:47:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I can prove that he sent me\Nif you give me a chance to show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.17,0:47:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The colonel sold\Nhundreds of those fish pendants
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.04,0:47:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,long before the war started.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.17,0:47:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Confine him.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.08,0:47:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time left! They're too close!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.83,0:47:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The colonel is preparing\Na counteroffensive
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.04,0:47:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,to regain control of the town!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.83,0:48:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Arcadio, listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.67,0:48:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-Listen to me! They're almost here!\N-Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.21,0:48:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Arcadio! Arcadio!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.38,0:48:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.50,0:48:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Those Conservatives are\Na bunch of fairies…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.96,0:48:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,…sending a spy dressed as a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.58,0:48:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,A woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.17,0:48:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a man dressed like a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.75,0:48:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He was saying\Nthat the Conservatives are coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.08,0:49:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Arcadio! Arcadio, what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.04,0:49:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, boss! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.17,0:49:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Run! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.50,0:49:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Take cover! Take cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.63,0:49:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.38,0:49:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yah!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.38,0:49:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.71,0:50:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.88,0:50:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.88,0:50:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.38,0:50:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Franco! Franco!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.08,0:50:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-We have to go!\N-To the station! To the station!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.29,0:50:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Run! Run! Go! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.58,0:50:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Make way!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.67,0:50:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.33,0:51:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Arcadio!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.29,0:51:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Run, boss! Go! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.17,0:51:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.21,0:51:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.71,0:51:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.29,0:51:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Arcadio! Set me free!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.46,0:51:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Spare me the indignity\Nof dying in restrains
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.50,0:51:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,dressed up as a woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.96,0:51:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Free me! Free me!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.04,0:51:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.96,0:52:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uh!\N-Uh!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.29,0:52:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.83,0:52:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah!\N-Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.08,0:52:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.96,0:52:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.13,0:52:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.00,0:52:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.79,0:52:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.67,0:53:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.38,0:54:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.79,0:54:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Be quiet. Be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.50,0:54:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Get out, you piece of shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.21,0:54:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out! Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.00,0:54:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't! Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.63,0:54:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Moscote, you need\Nto do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.79,0:55:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Moscote! You need to stop this massacre!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.38,0:55:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-And what do you expect me to do now?\N-Make them stop firing.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.38,0:55:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-Tell them to cease fire!\N-I have no power--
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.58,0:55:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.54,0:55:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Apolinar!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.21,0:55:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Arcadio!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.71,0:55:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Come with me! Come on! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.29,0:55:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Take shelter!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.00,0:55:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Get to safety!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.21,0:55:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-Run! Come on, let's go!\N-Hurry, let's get to the house!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.38,0:55:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,-Come on, Arcadio!\N-Arcadio, for God's sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.46,0:55:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop this madness!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.92,0:55:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.46,0:55:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Captain Roque Carnicero!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.25,0:55:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't come for you, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.63,0:55:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But our orders are clear.\NMove out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.67,0:56:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Arcadio.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.96,0:56:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.88,0:56:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-Don't you touch them.\N-Soldiers!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.92,0:56:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.79,0:57:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,In the last two hours\Nof his life,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.58,0:57:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Arcadio thought about his people\Nwithout sentimentality.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.63,0:57:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Confronting a hard reckoning,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.00,0:57:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,he began to understand how much\Nhe truly loved those he had hated most.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.96,0:57:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Any last words from you?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.54,0:57:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell my wife
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.42,0:57:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,that our little girl\Nshould be named Úrsula.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.21,0:57:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And if the baby is a boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.00,0:57:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,he shall be called José Arcadio.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.38,0:57:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Not after his uncle, but his grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.75,0:58:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.21,0:58:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.92,0:58:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Take aim!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.71,0:58:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.96,0:58:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-Long live the Liberal Party!\N-Soldiers, fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.88,0:58:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,BASED ON THE NOVEL BY\NGABRIEL GARCÍA MÁRQUEZ
